(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: the amplifier rails (feature blocks #32), drawn on two sub-sheets: the +-7 V\n   pre-rails with the -7 V enable shifter, and the paired +-6 V LDOs (ADR 0015).\n2. Absent state: HPA_RAIL_EN and HPA_LDO_EN pulled down: every rail off.\n3. Sub-sheet IDs (blk.hpa-rails-*) are sheets of blk.hpa-rails, as the SoC's sub-sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 147.32 0) (size 129.54 13.97) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e509d640-f1de-5001-bf82-806aa867fa31"))
